  "details": "Description\n\nWhen you're using the chat box, if you try to type a word that contains the letter y, it automatically closes the chat box and doesnt let you send anything, I expected to be able to type the letter 'y' without an issue?\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nOpen the chat box, and try to type the letter y, it'll auto close, no matter if the y is at the begining of the word, the middle, or the end. We have found no work arounds besides trying to avoid using the letter Y, which is really difficult\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1913-a070c3378e-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-17_23-32-29.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_034beb41-4ffe-4380-bdc1-829ddbfc1c04/1/file)",
